        {
            "title": "西屋電氣計劃IPO，估值目標逾500億美元",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"西屋電氣計劃IPO，估值目標逾500億美元\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"540\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/cc0fc3635d7b271c4e280833a3698f3c184bfdc4298f847d8fe5eae1d3759106/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fcontent-media.investing.com%2Fnews%2FLYNXMPEA6U04V_M.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">西屋電氣計劃IPO，估值目標逾500億美元</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Investing.com - 據彭博社週五引述知情人士報導，西屋電氣公司（<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":0,\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\",\"ySubModuleName\":\"anchor_text\"}' data-ylk=\"elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;subsec:anchor_text;\" href=\"https://hk.news.yahoo.com/tag/Westinghouse Electric Co\" rel=\"\">Westinghouse Electric Co</a>.）正為其美國首次公開募股（IPO）尋求逾500億美元的估值。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">這家核反應堆技術供應商由布魯克菲爾德可再生能源夥伴（Brookfield Renewable Partners）與卡梅科公司（Cameco Corp.）共同持有。知情人士透露，西屋電氣最快可能於10月正式提交上市申請，但相關細節及時間表仍可能有所調整。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-598afef2-348e-303d-9ab2-f68daede405d-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">消息公佈後，卡梅科的美國上市股票一度飆升3.6%，隨後漲幅有所收窄。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[94px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[94px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">報導指出，花旗集團（Citigroup Inc.）與高盛集團（Goldman Sachs Group Inc.）將主導此次IPO。西屋電氣早於7月宣佈已秘密提交上市申請。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">據報導，加拿大帝國商業銀行（Canadian Imperial Bank of Commerce）、摩根大通（JPMorgan Chase &amp; Co.）及加拿大皇家銀行（Royal Bank of Canada）亦參與其中。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">西屋電氣在全球21個國家擁有逾1.25萬名員工。根據卡梅科的業績公告，西屋電氣的核電技術服務於全球417座核反應堆中的57%，並擁有多達91個最新一代反應堆的潛在業務機會。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">卡梅科於2023年以約80億美元的估值收購了西屋電氣49%的股權。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><em>此文章由人工智能協助翻譯。更多資訊，請參閱我們的使用條款。</em></p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E8%A5%BF%E5%B1%8B%E9%9B%BB%E6%B0%A3%E8%A8%88%E5%8A%83ipo-%E4%BC%B0%E5%80%BC%E7%9B%AE%E6%A8%99%E9%80%BE500%E5%84%84%E7%BE%8E%E5%85%83-185132373.html",
            "pub_date": "2026-09-19 03:07:47",
            "source": "yahoo_finance_asia",
            "kind": 1,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "AI誤判險釀中美軍事衝突，人工智能錯將中國船貨識別為核武器零件",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"AI誤判險釀中美軍事衝突，人工智能錯將中國船貨識別為核武器零件\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"540\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/4d8e66c4a9909931ad36e8f1c252a93f0e1d05123980bf7d2029850ca7e6033e/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fcontent-media.investing.com%2Fnews%2FLYNXMPEBBT06A_M.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">AI誤判險釀中美軍事衝突，人工智能錯將中國船貨識別為核武器零件</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Investing.com - 據CNN週五引述知情人士報導，今年春天，美軍在中東地區幾乎對一艘中國船隻採取攔截行動。起因是<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":0,\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\",\"ySubModuleName\":\"anchor_text\"}' data-ylk=\"elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;subsec:anchor_text;\" href=\"https://hk.news.yahoo.com/tag/人工智能\" rel=\"\">人工智能</a>在伊朗戰爭期間，錯誤地將該船所載貨物識別為核武器相關零件，差點引發一場中美軍事衝突。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">當時，美軍武裝人員已準備好登船檢查，軍機亦已升空，直到官員發現情報有誤，才緊急叫停。據悉，部分官員形容這份情報「完全失實」，事件幾乎觸發兩國之間的直接對抗。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">事件源於一名隸屬美國特種作戰司令部的分析員，使用人工智能聊天機器人，對來自駐夏威夷的美國太平洋特種作戰司令部的船隻艙單情報進行分析。該AI工具將公開來源情報與機密信號情報混合處理，錯誤得出該船正在運送核武器計劃相關物資的結論。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-6b536b0c-e3fa-3147-ae9d-d8c1fb15313c-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">該分析員隨後再次借助AI，將上述分析結果整理成標準情報報告格式，而這類報告通常被軍方官員視為可信依據，並在軍中廣泛傳閱。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[94px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[94px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">事件發生之際，正值美國軍方與情報界加速將人工智能融入各項作戰任務，涵蓋情報分析、打擊目標選定，乃至後勤管理與預算規劃。國防部長皮特·赫格塞斯（Pete Hegseth）已於今年1月發布《人工智能加速戰略》，旨在推動軍事領域的AI應用提速。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">赫格塞斯在宣布該戰略時表示：「我們將大力推動實驗創新，消除官僚障礙，集中投資方向，並以實際行動證明我們有能力在軍事人工智能領域保持領先地位。」</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><em>此文章由人工智能協助翻譯。更多資訊，請參閱我們的使用條款。</em></p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/ai%E8%AA%A4%E5%88%A4%E9%9A%AA%E9%87%80%E4%B8%AD%E7%BE%8E%E8%BB%8D%E4%BA%8B%E8%A1%9D%E7%AA%81-%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E9%8C%AF%E5%B0%87%E4%B8%AD%E5%9C%8B%E8%88%B9%E8%B2%A8%E8%AD%98%E5%88%A5%E7%82%BA%E6%A0%B8%E6%AD%A6%E5%99%A8%E9%9B%B6%E4%BB%B6-182607572.html",
            "pub_date": "2026-09-19 03:07:49",
            "source": "yahoo_finance_asia",
            "kind": 1,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "日圓兌美元大漲逾1日圓，日本央行匯率查詢引發市場關注",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"日圓兌美元大漲逾1日圓，日本央行匯率查詢引發市場關注\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"540\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/74ed0781e82e31152689f8820f49e0c4ac7b8b9e6e93e27627559007408218ad/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fcontent-media.investing.com%2Fnews%2FBank-of-Japan_M_1440048415.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">日圓兌美元大漲逾1日圓，日本央行匯率查詢引發市場關注</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Investing.com - 週五晚間至週六凌晨日本時間，日圓兌美元匯率大幅升值逾1日圓，一度攀升至156日圓區間上方。此波升值行情源於日本央行（BOJ）向市場參與者進行匯率查詢，詢問當前匯率水準，此消息由《日本經濟新聞》（Nikkei）率先報導。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">匯率查詢通常被市場視為外匯干預前的預備動作。日本央行此舉令市場參與者對日本政府及央行可能採取買入日圓、賣出美元的外匯干預行動的憂慮明顯升溫。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><em>此文章由人工智能協助翻譯。更多資訊，請參閱我們的使用條款。</em></p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E6%97%A5%E5%9C%93%E5%85%8C%E7%BE%8E%E5%85%83%E5%A4%A7%E6%BC%B2%E9%80%BE1%E6%97%A5%E5%9C%93-%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC%E5%A4%AE%E8%A1%8C%E5%8C%AF%E7%8E%87%E6%9F%A5%E8%A9%A2%E5%BC%95%E7%99%BC%E5%B8%82%E5%A0%B4%E9%97%9C%E6%B3%A8-170753636.html",
            "pub_date": "2026-09-19 01:21:33",
            "source": "yahoo_finance_asia",
            "kind": 1,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "日圓跌幅收窄 日本央行據報進行匯率摸底",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">【彭博】-- 日圓收窄了因<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":0,\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\",\"ySubModuleName\":\"anchor_text\"}' data-ylk=\"elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;subsec:anchor_text;\" href=\"https://hk.news.yahoo.com/tag/日本央行\" rel=\"\">日本央行</a>未能就進一步加息計畫提供更明確指引而引發的跌幅，此前《日經新聞》報導稱，日本央行在外匯市場進行了「匯率摸底」。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">截至紐約時間周五中午，日圓下跌0.6%，報1美元兌156.83日圓，盤中早些時候一度下跌1.3%。日經新聞報導稱，日本央行向市場參與者詢問了匯率水平，但未透露信息來源。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">原文標題Yen Pares BOJ-Fueled Declines as Nikkei Reports a Rate Check</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-65fccee8-e864-3a12-bdda-eba73db7d393-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">More stories like this are available on <a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"bloomberg.com\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:bloomberg.com;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://www.bloomberg.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">bloomberg.com</a></p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[94px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[94px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">©2026 Bloomberg L.P.</p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E6%97%A5%E5%9C%93%E8%B7%8C%E5%B9%85%E6%94%B6%E7%AA%84-%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC%E5%A4%AE%E8%A1%8C%E6%93%9A%E5%A0%B1%E9%80%B2%E8%A1%8C%E5%8C%AF%E7%8E%87%E6%91%B8%E5%BA%95-161429795.html",
            "pub_date": "2026-09-19 00:52:51",
